      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Since VRChat has gotten funds , and they can be declared a off-profit company , they could use google Speech-To-Text API , and make a deal with VRC+ users to access captions service, hence helping the deaf community, to be more included with other people, and i agree with the two choices, hud or above the player, it could look very nice.\nalso for the clues, VRChat could make a optional choice and rely by default on english language, but if a user sets a language tag, like (English, Japanese or Italian)\nit could help the speech-to-text to process captions as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
